  "body": "Completed and ready to move into, this collection of stylish townhouses is just a five-minutes (approx.) stroll from Mairangi Bay village and beach. Considered architectural design has created light, bright and comfortable living environments that are finished to an impeccable standard. Each residence has internal garaging, a security system and lift to each floor, and they come in a choice of three well-proportioned, flexible typologies that will suit all life stages. Concrete block and vertical weatherboard construction is durable and easy-care. \r\n\r\nThe village offers a great selection of cafes, bars, restaurants and boutiques, as well as the renovated Woolworths supermarket. The golden beach is a safe and popular swimming bay and has access to the picturesque coastal walkways that link the East Coast Bays. Top schools are all within walking distance and motorway onramps are close by for commuters.  \r\n\r\n2/20, 3/20 and 5/20 Penzance Road\r\nThese 183m2 (more or less) homes have a single garage and three bedrooms with ensuites – one on the ground floor and the other two on the top floor. The open-plan living, dining and kitchen level opens out at either end for optimum light and airflow and there is another living space also located upstairs. \r\n\r\n6/20 Penzance Road\r\nThis 180m2 (more or less) home has a single internal garage. There’s one bedroom with ensuite downstairs and a large open-plan living, dining and kitchen upstairs. The top floor master has an ensuite and sea views, while the other bedroom is serviced by the main bathroom.",
